From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 06:08:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 505/638] mojo: expose AROS channel retirement completion

Track endpoint references, reader activity, and MessagePort teardown in a move-only retirement observer. A child is now considered transport-retired only after both endpoint sides are closed, reader tasks are joined, and ports are gone, giving the browser an independent lifecycle barrier before replacement.



